// This source holds two presentations wider than one round of the checker's
// unfolding fuel. `Named` has 64 constants at `String`. `Flags` has 48
// constants at `Bool`. The entries of each model check at the type that its
// presentation computes.
//
// `std.build`'s `modelType` computes the type of a presentation's entries,
// one entry for each constant. A wide presentation unfolds in many steps. A
// small budget for each round of the reading cannot unfold it.
//
// The checker reads a computed type with one budget for the whole reading.
// It fills the solved holes of the type in one walk. So one round unfolds
// the whole presentation.
//
// - see: #6046 — `modelType`
// - see: #6181
import std.build (modelType, Entry, Ended);

/// A theory of 64 names.
theory Named where {
  /// Constant 0.
  oper n0 : String;
